# Working files. None of these are referenced by any served page — checked with
# a grep across every html/js/css before excluding them.
#
# Left in, the deploy uploads ~700 MB and fails outright: handover.zip alone is
# 153 MB, over Vercel's 100 MB per-file limit.

iar-lab

# generation scratch: masters, raw renders, graded sets, contact sheets
images/_*

# the client handover package — a deliverable, not part of the site
handover
handover.zip

# the originals from the client's Drive: 6000x4000 camera files
images/_orig
# the mark clips' video sources — the site now ships the keyed webp instead
assets/*.mp4

# previews written by iar-lab/fit.py, alongside whatever it checked
*-fit.jpg

# test harnesses: a real page with its database swapped for fixtures, so a
# screen can be walked without an account. Never for the live site.
_*fit.html

# placket correction working set: 2k PNG masters, not served
placket-fixed
tmp-src

# Internal working documents. Nothing on the site links to a .md — checked with
# a grep across every html and js before adding this — but every one of them was
# being served: PENDING-FROM-CLIENT.md, LAUNCH.md and CONTENT.md all returned
# 200 on the live domain, which put the client's open commercial risks, our
# internal decisions and their unreleased copy one URL away from anybody.
*.md

# The button and cuff close-up masters: 162 MB of PNGs, one per cloth plus the
# drafts. The served frames are derived into images/set/<slug>/4-cuff.webp and
# 5-button.webp with their tiers, so nothing here is referenced by any page.
# Left in, they alone are larger than the entire rest of the deploy.
IAMRATAN-all-button-closeups
cuff-images

# The hero source PNGs (9 MB). The served crops live in images/hero/.
new-hero
images/hero/_bak

# The superseded About pages. house.html is now version three, and its assets
# ship under neutral names (assets/about.*, images/about) because they are the
# About page's assets now, not an experiment's. What is left here is the three
# versions it replaced, kept for reference and deployed to the preview project
# on purpose, but never to the client's domain. The preview build strips these
# lines back out.
house-1.html
house-2.html
house-3.html
assets/house2.*
images/house2

# the banner source PNGs, 6 MB. The served crops live in images/hero/.
new-banners
images/hero/_bak2

# Design studies, never linked from the site. Checked before excluding: no page
# a visitor can reach links to any of these, they only link to each other. They
# were being deployed all the same, which put fifteen half-finished layouts and
# a megabyte of their images one guessed URL away from the client.
directions.html
loom.html
mockup.html
preview.html
range.html
shop-a.html
shop-b.html
shop-c.html
shop-grid.html
shop-index.html
shop-wall.html
variant-*.html
images/collar-0*.jpg
images/hero-loop-poster.jpg
images/cuff-monogram.jpg

# the journal photographs that were replaced, and the jpg twins of ones that
# have long been served as webp
images/journal/*.jpg
images/journal/lobby.webp
images/journal/night.webp
images/journal/road.webp
